flowchart TD
  A[Resolve sender from metadata or event] --> B{sender code exists?}
  B -->|No| C[no delegation clean]
  B -->|Yes| D{code starts with 0xef0100?}
  D -->|No| E[sender has non-EIP7702 code]
  D -->|Yes| F[extract delegation target]
  F --> G{target in malicious set?}
  G -->|Yes| H[flag high risk hard-stop]
  G -->|No| J{target in safe set?}
  J -->|Yes| K[allow low risk]
  J -->|No| L[estimate contract age]
  L --> M{new contract?}
  M -->|Yes| N[flag high risk]
  M -->|No| O[flag moderate risk]
